    rdfs:label "Hygiene Concern — Bathroom or Linen Deficit Observed" ;
    rdfs:comment "Maintenance worker finds a hygiene deficit upon entering the unit: soiled or unchanged linens, uncleaned bathroom (soiling, odor, unflushed), depleted hygiene products, or evidence of incontinence-related hygiene failure. A concern is logged immediately — D7 rises while D2 stays LOW (hygiene not normal). HYGIENE_ALERT is written to perceptual space, feeding the DailyPatientCare machine's bathroom-nonuse detection path." ;
    re:hasStep m:step-hc-visit , m:step-hc-accessible , m:step-hc-hygiene-concern ;
    re:hasInitialStep m:step-hc-visit .

